Chansey is Nurse Joy's only known Pokémon. She helps her with nursing Pokémon at the Pokémon Center. Three different Chansey belonging to three different Nurse Joy appeared in I Choose You!, a set in an alternate continuity to . 

One appeared working alongside Nurse Joy in a Pokémon Center in a forest, where she helped taking care of an injured . Another belonging to a second Nurse Joy worked alongside her in a Pokémon Center in an unnamed town. She helped take care of Ash's Charmeleon after it got badly injured in a battle with Cross. A third worked with its Nurse Joy in a Pokémon Center near a lake, close to the Raizen Mountains. It helped heal after he had battled with .
